    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n365" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγαμαι</span>) later form of <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγητός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>admirable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				268
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκέτι μοι βίος ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					168
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκεῖνο δὲ κρίνω τοῦ ἀνδρὸς ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					2.3.56
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.</u>
				1.9.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Aem.</u>
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Aed.</u>
				1.4
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τῶς,</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				243
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				1.24
			</span></i>. (Pure 
				Att.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαυμαστός.</span>)</div>
